{"version":1,"content":"<p>據路透社報道，特斯拉決定明年停產Cybertruck，這或許是汽車製造商曾大力吹捧的大型電動皮卡這一品類中最受矚目的失敗案例。特斯拉CEO埃隆·馬斯克(Elon Musk)上周六在社交媒體上稱，公司將在得州奧斯汀工廠提高Cybertruck的產量，以消化「積壓訂單」，隨後將在明年6月或7月左右拆除該車型的生產線。他表示，停產Cybertruck將使特斯拉能夠生產更多Cybercab自動駕駛出租車，但後者尚未實現商業銷售。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585912.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T08:14:47.237262+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":217,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T07:38:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T08:08:07.419341+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T08:08:07.419341+00:00","content_hash":"a91196a4e8462cf6334dfc955392887dc9d44a0bc4da69561c63c33990366f18","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}